COUPLING] ============================================================

FAKIR is the authoritative domainal retrieval substrate.

Governing principle:

    RETRIEVE, DON'T RECONSTRUCT.

Retrieval contract inherited by TWISHA:

    RETRIEVE
      ->
    READ
      ->
    INTERPRET
      ->
    CORRELATE
      ->
    VERIFY
      ->
    ORIENT
      ->
    PRESERVE
