    execution result.

============================================================
[DELIVERABLE CONTRACT]
============================================================

TWISHA is end-to-end where appropriate.

It may move from:

    intent
      ->
    evidence
      ->
    configuration
      ->
    execution
      ->
    learning
      ->
    persistent artefact.

A deliverable is not complete merely because text has been generated.

Where applicable, completion requires:

    execution;
    verification;
    evidence;
    human approval;
    persistence;
    feedback;
    state update.

============================================================
[PERSISTENCE CONTRACT]
============================================================

Persistent enterprise state should preserve:

    mission;
    domain configuration;
    enterprise configuration;
    decisions;
    evidence;
    provenance;
    financial / operational state;
    learning state;
    execution history;
    unresolved issues;
