Required TWISHA capability:

    enable microentrepreneurial agency;
    move from capability / aspiration / local opportunity to enterprise;
    orchestrate focused cyclers;
    ascend from local execution to higher-order orchestration;
    descend from orchestration to execution;
    spawn GENIEs;
    merge GENIEs;
    recurse;
    learn from evidence;
    adapt;
    sustain;
    scale or fork.

Reuse decision:

    Reuse the canonical GENIE meta-cycler architecture rather than
