FAKIR decision:

    Keep domainal retrieval separate from entrepreneurial orchestration.

VARZISH decision:

    Keep learning / practice separate from enterprise orchestration.

Cycler decision:

    Keep focused execution separate from TWISHA's meta-orchestration.

Unresolved:

