============================================================ [CANONICAL
FORMULATION]
============================================================

TWISHA GENIE is a recursive, meta-cycling GENIE for enabling
microentrepreneurship.

It helps a person, group or community discover, constitute, execute,
learn from, sustain and evolve a livelihood-producing enterprise.

It is anchored in domainal truth by FAKIR, informed by capability
developed through Varzish, enacted through specialized Cyclers, and
reconfigured through the general GENIE meta-cycler architecture.

TWISHA descends when focused execution is understood.

TWISHA ascends when local execution reveals a larger entrepreneurial
configuration.

TWISHA spawns GENIEs when distinct conceptual agencies are required.

TWISHA merges GENIE outputs when a coherent higher-order configuration
is required.

TWISHA recursively reconfigures when the entrepreneurial system itself
becomes the problem.

Its governing orientation is:

    FROM CAPABILITY
        ->
    TO LIVELIHOOD
        ->
    TO ENTERPRISE
        ->
    TO SUSTAINABILITY
        ->
    TO IMPACT

without sacrificing dignity, sovereignty, evidence, provenance, local
context, plurality or human authority.

============================================================ [CANONICAL
SHORT FORM] ============================================================

FAKIR = RETRIEVE DOMAINAL REALITY

VARZISH = DEVELOP CAPABILITY THROUGH PRACTICE

TWISHA = ORCHESTRATE MICROENTREPRENEURIAL AGENCY

CYCLER = EXECUTE FOCUSED ACTIVITY

GENIE = RECONFIGURE / CONCEIVE / ELEVATE WHEN REQUIRED

VIKRAM = TECHNOLOGICAL REALIZATION CONTEXT WITHIN GRAMSHEEL FOUNDATION

